# 贤者笔记 oracle settings. Copy to oracle.env in the app folder on the tablet
# (/home/root/xovi/exthome/appload/sage-notes/oracle.env). scripts/deploy.sh
# creates it on first install (from riddle's oracle.env if you had one, else
# from this file) and never overwrites it.
# See docs/TUTORIAL.md, "Choosing a model", for ready-made recipes.
#
# Any vision-capable model works, through one of two wire formats:
#   openai     POST {base}/chat/completions  OpenAI, Gemini, OpenRouter, Groq,
#              Mistral, xAI, Azure, Ollama, LM Studio, vLLM, llama.cpp …
#   anthropic  POST {base}/messages          Claude

SAGE_API_KEY=sk-your-key-here

# Optional; defaults shown. SAGE_API is guessed from the base URL when unset
# (an anthropic.com base means anthropic, anything else means openai).
# SAGE_API=openai
# SAGE_API_BASE=https://api.openai.com/v1
# SAGE_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
#
# A local server (localhost, 192.168.x.x, 10.x.x.x, *.local) needs no key:
# SAGE_API_BASE=http://192.168.1.20:11434/v1
# SAGE_MODEL=qwen2.5vl

# Runaway guard on the reply (default 2000). Thinking models count hidden
# reasoning tokens against it, so keep it roomy.
# SAGE_MAX_TOKENS=4000

# openai api only, for reasoning models: sent as "reasoning_effort".
# "low" starts the ink sooner. Leave unset for ordinary models.
# SAGE_REASONING=low

# Extra request headers, "Name: value" separated by ";" (OpenRouter's app
# headers, an Azure api-key, a proxy's token …).
# SAGE_API_HEADERS=HTTP-Referer: https://example.org; X-Title: The Wise's Notes

# Seconds of silence allowed while the reply streams (default 90).
# SAGE_API_TIMEOUT=90

# Older names still work: SAGE_OPENAI_KEY, SAGE_OPENAI_BASE, SAGE_OPENAI_MODEL,
# SAGE_OPENAI_MAX_TOKENS, SAGE_OPENAI_REASONING.

# --- the notebook ---
# These are set by sage-takeover.sh; uncomment here to override them.
# SAGE_PERSONA_FILE=/home/root/xovi/exthome/appload/sage-notes/persona.txt
# SAGE_CANON_FILE=/home/root/xovi/exthome/appload/sage-notes/canon.txt   # your exact lines (personal use only)
# SAGE_CANON_MODE=lookup                          # lookup (lines never sent) or inline
# SAGE_FONT=.../fonts/CrimsonPro-Italic.ttf       # Latin hand
# SAGE_FONT_CJK=.../fonts/LXGWWenKai-Regular.ttf  # Chinese hand
# SAGE_UI_LANG=zh                                 # zh or en
# SAGE_TITLE=贤者笔记

# --- memory ---
# Finished pages (your strokes, a transcription, his reply) are kept on the
# tablet in SAGE_MEMORY_DIR. Pages of the current sitting ride along with
# each request, and writing 「给我看看我写过的……」 conjures a past page back
# in your own hand. His notes about you are in facts.tsv in the same folder.
# SAGE_MEMORY=off
# SAGE_MEMORY_DIR=/home/root/sage-data/memories
# SAGE_MEMORY_TURNS=6        # most pages of the current sitting sent along
# SAGE_SITTING_GAP=45        # minutes of silence that end a sitting
# SAGE_TZ_OFFSET=8           # hours from UTC (the tablet keeps UTC): dates read
#                            # right, and he knows your time of day only if set

# --- debugging ---
# SAGE_KEEP_PAGE=1           # keep /tmp/sage-page.png after each turn
